  "ingredients": [
    "1 (0.6 ounce) cake compressed fresh yeast",
    "1 cup lukewarm milk",
    "2.25 cups all-purpose flour",
    "2 teaspoons salt",
    "1 large egg",
    "0.75 cup dried currants",
    "0.75 cup raisins",
    "1 medium Granny Smith apple - peeled, cored and finely chopped",
    "1 quart vegetable oil for deep-frying",
    "1 cup confectioners' sugar for dusting"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/qWobnmgZ3cxtbewAy8_eCoSvnKM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/46299-oliebollen-dutch-doughnuts-DDMFS-step-01-28dddd25ea8249a68d48bdd977660af1.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/46299/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Break up compressed yeast and stir into warm milk. Let stand for a few minutes to dissolve.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/SR6_GR-EpyB-lWPex01jCSFtDOs=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/46299-oliebollen-dutch-doughnuts-DDMFS-step-02-d52dcf7237404b05a22867a146447647.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/46299/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Sift flour and salt into a large bowl. Stir in yeast mixture and egg until smooth. Fold in currants, raisins, and apple.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/YR7HFmtR3w_IKW4wvq9gdPM8c8I=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/46299-oliebollen-dutch-doughnuts-DDMFS-step-03-ee2c2e9a1002458da637cf84d9ec15e3.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/46299/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cover the bowl and set in a warm place to rise until doubled in volume, about 1 hour.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/F7gTG-EvZpyHwCTdJ_65AGp-KIA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/46299-oliebollen-dutch-doughnuts-DDMFS-step-04-e8216381fe3240f699c194f901b4c778.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/46299/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Heat oil in a deep fryer or heavy pot to 375 degrees F (190 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/D-OWhYU24E_IIsDxeZkkVm2pdQw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/46299-oliebollen-dutch-doughnuts-DDMFS-step-05-a4071a55ff5c4290a4cbadf089dd98f8.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/46299/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Use two metal spoons to shape scoops of dough into 12 balls.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/C8GoefGHvmgFtBHeXKJUummtSgI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/46299-oliebollen-dutch-doughnuts-DDMFS-step-06-0521295e9c144352b65206b3885bfab5.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/46299/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Drop them carefully into the hot oil and fry until golden brown, about 8 minutes. Remove doughnuts with a slotted spoon and drain on paper towels.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/RxZyFJoIyEr1tx2EWngsy7UwXSc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/46299-oliebollen-dutch-doughnuts-DDMFS-step-07-9633d626ffd8402cac1b3c1f3209559a.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/46299/step_07.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Dust warm doughnuts with confectioners’ sugar, transfer to a serving platter, and sprinkle with more sugar just before serving.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/wExmuT9haxeDm8E2WEKs7Z44vSU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/46299-oliebollen-dutch-doughnuts-DDMFS-Beauty-4x3-95f08a9ddedd4cf4a859302bb14b7858.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/46299/step_08.webp"
    }
  ],
